{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261113/photo/bkn-20261113191723995-1113_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261113191723\"/><p>事主被轉送至瑪嘉烈醫院治療。</p><p>今午(13日)5時22分，一名姓葉(41歲)女子在荃灣河背街77號的家中暈倒，由母親發現後報案。事主昏迷被送往仁濟醫院治理，其後再被轉送至瑪嘉烈醫院，其暈倒原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:00:54.701978+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:17:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:55:52.074260+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:54:16.963661+00:00","content_hash":"a51720d1123f86f96060c156807fc577d90fcb1147e4629071ae06645e5874f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}